Fines, of any kind, should not be a revenue stream;

In my country, law enforcement officially announces when and what type of inspections they will be conducting. For example, the first week of February will focus on speed control, the second week will address seatbelts, child seats, and winter tires, and the third week will target drunk driving, etc.

We also have road signs a few hundred meters in front of every stationary speed camera, so that drivers actually slow down in those zones.
